body:
A great to-do app for solo use. Lots of great features that rival paid / subscription apps.

Shared list functionality is the limiting factor:
- can’t add shared lists to folders, impeding basic organization;
- moving an assigned to-do from one shared list to another removes assignment, even if the individual belongs to both shared lists;
- no option to share tags (which would provide a work around for persistent assignment);

Other issues:
- rearranging by drag &amp; drop is inconsistent. Often requires two attempts.
- adding, editing and viewing notes is less natural than most apple UX;

I hope Apple will continue to invest in this app and improve the existing functionality app while adding new features - a viable native to-do app is a huge asset. This one is already far superior to Microsoft To-Do or gmail alternatives.
